{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":102855,"name":"Victor","username":"Victor1","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.creality.com/victor1/{size}/30639_2.png","created_at":"2025-12-05T03:31:05.331Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI am experiencing a serious issue with my Creality HALOT SKY 2022 resin printer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe printer turns on normally, the UV LEDs work, and the mirror is clean.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHowever, the LCD does not display any layer image during printing, and the problem persists even after installing a brand new original 9.25’’ 6K mono LCD.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDescription of the problem:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e·         During printing, the UV backlight turns on, but the LCD remains completely dark.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e·         No layer pattern is projected on the LCD surface.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e·         Running Clean Screen also produces the same result: the entire center area stays dark.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActions already taken:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.     Installed a brand new original LCD panel (9.25’’ 6K mono) specifically made for HALOT SKY 2022.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBut, no improvement.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease advise:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.     How to properly diagnose whether the issue is the LCD driver board or mainboard?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2.     Do you have official replacement parts for the HALOT SKY 2022:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e·         LCD driver board\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e·         Ribbon cable\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e·         Mainboard (if required)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI can provide photos and videos if needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you in advance.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLooking forward to your assistance.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2025-12-05T03:31:05.331Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":154,"